rName":"Ruijin","textMapHash":3298790338,"text":"Oh, never heard of it? Allow me to introduce it to you then. Theater Mechanicus is a kind of tabletop game invented by yours truly.","nextNodeIds":[400000204]},{"nodeId":400000204,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30043,"speakerName":"Ruijin","textMapHash":3683112210,"text":"Do you see these things laid out on the table here? These are all important items used in Theater Mechanicus.","nextNodeIds":[400000205]},{"nodeId":400000205,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2353614634,"text":"Looks pretty complicated...","nextNodeIds":[400000206]},{"nodeId":400000206,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30043,"speakerName":"Ruijin","textMapHash":3580627434,"text":"It may seem complicated, but you'll get the hang of it after you play a couple of times.","nextNodeIds":[400000207]},{"nodeId":400000207,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30043,"speakerName":"Ruijin","textMapHash":2984990162,"text":"So, how about it? Would you like to give it a try?","nextNodeIds":[400000208,400000209]},{"nodeId":400000208,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1179798850,"text":"Uh, well how much does it cost to play?","nextNodeIds":[400000210]},{"nodeId":400000210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30043,"speakerName":"Ruijin","textMapHash":2247273242,"text":"No, not at all. It is the Lantern Rite, after all. Besides, I was hoping to collect everyone's initial impressions of the game.","nextNodeIds":[400000211]},{"nodeId":400000211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30043,"speakerName":"Ruijin","textMapHash":1026945378,"text":"So all it'll cost you to play is a single Xiao Lantern.","nextNodeIds":[400000212]},{"nodeId":400000212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30043,"speakerName":"Ruijin","textMapHash":273312738,"text":"If you'd like to try, just bring me a Xiao Lantern and you'll be good to go!","nextNodeIds":[400000213]},{"nodeId":400000213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30043,"speakerName":"Ruijin","textMapHash":1035238578,"text":"C'mon, give it a try! I'll even let you play the first round for free and you can keep your Xiao Lantern.","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":400000209,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1967337418,"text":"It must be pretty expensive...","nextNodeIds":[400000210]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[4000002,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""},{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[4000002,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_FINISH_PLOT","PPFLKMOMKAI":""},{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7000,260],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_ENTER_DUNGEON","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["30043"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":4000003,"order":3,"stepDescription":"Try Theater Mechanicus","stepDescTextMapHash":3143857628,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7000,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_FINISH_DUNGEON","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["30043"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"},"isHidden":false,"talkIds":[4000003],"talks":[{"talkId":4000003,"talkCon